# arcus-arb Phase A environment / Phase A 环境变量
#
# No environment variables or secrets are required for record-only:
#
#   python3 main.py --symbol SNDK --hedge lighter-rh --record-only
#
# Phase B0 only, after an explicit --tiny-live --confirm-mainnet preflight:
# ARCUS_ACCOUNT_ADDRESS=0x...
# ARCUS_API_KEY=<64 hex Ed25519 public key>
# ARCUS_ED25519_PRIVATE_KEY_FILE=/secure/local/path/arcus-ed25519.key
# ARCUS_ACCOUNT_INDEX=0
#
# Use either ARCUS_ED25519_PRIVATE_KEY_FILE or the environment variable
# ARCUS_ED25519_PRIVATE_KEY; never commit either value. B0 never generates a
# wallet, registers an API key, or prints private key material.
#
# Existing Lighter-RH variables are loaded by the mature adapter. See the
# comments below and keep the real .env ignored by Git.
